00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:06,300
To change how the app looks, click the Theme icon on the right.

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:11,720
Pick Light for a bright screen.

3
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:16,080
The whole app, charts included, switches straight away.

4
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:24,280
Font Size makes all the text smaller or bigger.

5
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:32,710
Pick Dark to go back. Your choice is saved with your profile.

